<h1 id="getting-started">Getting Started</h1>

<p>The whole implementation is fairly simple — no more than 200 lines of code.</p>

<p><img src="/assets/images/20190321UIScrollTextDemo/scrolltextdemo1.avif" alt="scrolltextdemo" /></p>

<p>First, we need two CALayers:</p>

<ul>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">CATextLayer</code> for displaying text</li>
  <li><code class="language-plaintext highlighter-rouge">CAGradientLayer</code> for adding a mask to the text</li>
</ul>

